  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Policy Framework and Capacity for Effective Migration and Asylum Management in Armenia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action will contribute to the overall objective of ensuring more effective and accountable service delivery that is based on the principles of good governance and respect of rule of law in the areas of migration, asylum and human rights. That includes: Development of Migration Strategy and Action Plan; Improvement of the refugee protection legislation; Institutionalization of induction and technical training; Introduction of a &#xBF;one-stop shop&#xBF; for provision of entry, work and all other type of residence documents to foreigners; Improvement of refugee status determination; Digitization of asylum procedures and Enhancement of the reception capacity&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
